§ `s 487.04 -- designated offence`

-- designated offence means a primary designated offence or a secondary designated offence
#ASSERT `s 487.04 the offence is a designated offence` (`s 487.04 test: a provision of this Act` 235 "") EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- primary
#ASSERT `s 487.04 the offence is a designated offence` (`s 487.04 test: a provision of this Act` 266 "") EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- secondary (c)(vii)
#ASSERT `s 487.04 the offence is a designated offence` (`s 487.04 test: a prosecution of a provision of this Act` 266 "" `s 487.04 another purpose` FALSE FALSE (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 2, 0, 0, FALSE))) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 487.04 the offence is a designated offence` (`s 487.04 test: a prosecution of a provision of this Act` 380 "" `s 487.04 another purpose` FALSE FALSE (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 2, 0, 0, FALSE))) EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- neither
#ASSERT `s 487.04 the offence is a designated offence` (`s 487.04 test: a prosecution of a provision of this Act` 380 "" `s 487.04 another purpose` TRUE FALSE `no imprisonment is stated`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- not covered: the maximum is not stated
